  - m_Id: 155645370388
    m_Localized: "WASD \u2014 run    mouse \u2014 aim    LMB \u2014 throw (hold to
      charge)    Q \u2014 flashlight in the dark\nRMB / E \u2014 catch or grab a
      ball nearby    Space / Shift \u2014 dash    F \u2014 newsstand    Tab \u2014
      pockets    Esc \u2014 pause\nGamepad: left stick, right stick, RT \u2014 throw,
      LT \u2014 catch, A \u2014 dash, LB \u2014 flashlight, X \u2014 newsstand, Select
      \u2014 pockets\nH \u2014 hide hints"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
