    m_Localized: Not enough coins
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1427114170507288
    m_Localized: "Tab / Esc \u2014 close    You can drop a card when your pockets
      are full, or sell one at the newsstand\nGamepad: Select / B \u2014 close"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1427114170507289
    m_Localized: "Click or Enter \u2014 mark, again \u2014 drop    1\u20136 \u2014
      quick pick    Esc \u2014 back to cards\nGamepad: A \u2014 mark and confirm,
      B \u2014 back"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1427114170507290
    m_Localized: "pockets {0}/{1} \xB7 Tab"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1427114170507291
    m_Localized: "Your pockets {0}/{1}    Tab \u2014 details"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1427114170507292
    m_Localized: "new pocket \xB7 {0}/{1}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1427114170507293
    m_Localized: "upgrade \xB7 same pocket"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1427114170507294
    m_Localized: no pocket
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1427114170507295
    m_Localized: "combo \xB7 frees a pocket"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1427114170507296
    m_Localized: "pockets full \xB7 drop one"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1427114170507297
    m_Localized: Pockets
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170816
    m_Localized: Bestiary
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170817
    m_Localized: FIRST TIME IN THE YARD?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170818
    m_Localized: "A couple of minutes of practice: running, throwing, catching, dashing,
      cards and the newsstand. You can also take it later: Notebook \u2192 How to
      play."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170819
    m_Localized: Yes, teach me
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170820
    m_Localized: No, let's play
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170821
    m_Localized: Practice in the yard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170822
    m_Localized: "Your tasks are on the left. Esc \u2014 pause: restart or quit from
      there"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170823
    m_Localized: "TUTORIAL \xB7 {0} of {1}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170824
    m_Localized: Done!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170825
    m_Localized: '{0} / {1}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170826
    m_Localized: Run around the yard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170827
    m_Localized: WASD or the left stick
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170828
    m_Localized: Knock out the roly-polys
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170829
    m_Localized: "Aim with the mouse or the right stick. LMB or RT \u2014 throw.
      One hit is enough for a roly-poly"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170830
    m_Localized: Pick up your balls
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170831
    m_Localized: Walk up to a ball and it jumps into your hands. RMB / E / LT next
      to a ball grabs it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170832
    m_Localized: Charged throw
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170833
    m_Localized: 'Hold LMB / RT until the bar over your head fills up, then let go:
      the ball flies faster, farther and hits twice as hard'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170834
    m_Localized: Catch the soldier's ball
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170835
    m_Localized: "When a ball flies at you from the front, press RMB / E / LT. Press
      at the last moment for a golden perfect catch \u2014 it heals a heart"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170836
    m_Localized: Dash
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170837
    m_Localized: "Space / Shift / A \u2014 dash. Balls and hits pass through you
      mid-dash"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170838
    m_Localized: Knock them all out!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170839
    m_Localized: "Catch the soldiers' balls \u2014 they keep you stocked with balls
      and hearts. Baby dolls are fast but fall to one hit"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170840
    m_Localized: Elite!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170841
    m_Localized: 'A golden mark on the ground means an elite: tougher than usual,
      with a trick of its own. The golden matryoshka opens into two roly-polys'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170842
    m_Localized: School bag
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170843
    m_Localized: "The elite dropped a school bag \u2014 pick it up and choose a card.
      Cards power you up until the end of the walk"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170844
    m_Localized: Pockets
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170845
    m_Localized: "The card went into a pocket. Tab / Select \u2014 open your pockets
      to see what each card does. You only have six"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170846
    m_Localized: The newsstand
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170847
    m_Localized: "After an arena the newsstand opens: walk up and press F / X. Coins
      drop from enemies \u2014 here's a bit extra for the first time. It sells gum
      with cards, lemonade and a sandwich"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170848
    m_Localized: READY TO PLAY!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170849
    m_Localized: "A walk goes from the yard to the hockey box or the flea market,
      then the construction site or the kindergarten \u2014 and home before mom calls.
      The newsstand opens after every arena. The Bestiary in the Notebook tells you
      about every enemy."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170850
    m_Localized: Let's go!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170851
    m_Localized: BESTIARY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170852
    m_Localized: Enemies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170853
    m_Localized: Elites
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170854
    m_Localized: Bosses
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170855
    m_Localized: 'Hits: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170856
    m_Localized: "Elite \xB7 hits: {0} \xB7 may drop a school bag"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588411170857
    m_Localized: "Boss \xB7 hits: {0}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588415365120
    m_Localized: 'Where: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588415365121
    m_Localized: How to beat it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588415365122
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588415365123
    m_Localized: "Boss \xB7 not defeated yet"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588415365124
    m_Localized: Defeat it to fill in this page.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588415365125
    m_Localized: 'Unlocked: {0} of {1}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455588415365126
    m_Localized: "Arrows / stick \u2014 choose    \u2190/\u2192 \u2014 section   
      Q / E, LB / RB \u2014 page    Esc / B \u2014 back"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1461472117907456
    m_Localized: Notebook
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1461472126296064
    m_Localized: How to play
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1461472126296065
    m_Localized: new!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1461472126296066
    m_Localized: "Q / E, LB / RB \u2014 page    Esc / B \u2014 back"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1461472126296067
    m_Localized: Controls
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1461472126296068
    m_Localized: "WASD / left stick \u2014 run\nmouse / right stick \u2014 aim\nLMB
      / RT \u2014 throw, hold to charge\nRMB / E / LT \u2014 catch or grab a ball
      nearby\nSpace / Shift / A \u2014 dash\nQ / LB \u2014 flashlight in the dark\nF
      / X \u2014 newsstand    Tab / Select \u2014 pockets\nEsc / Start \u2014 pause   
      H \u2014 in-game hints"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1461472126296069
    m_Localized: Yard rules
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1461472126296070
    m_Localized: "Knock out the toys with a ball and catch their balls: a caught
      ball is yours, and a perfect last-moment catch heals a heart. Don't catch the
      red spiky hedgehog \u2014 dodge it.\n\nEnemies drop coins, elites (golden mark)
      drop a school bag with cards. Cards go into six pockets.\n\nAfter an arena
      the newsstand opens, then an arrow leads on \u2014 pick your path at the fork.
      In the final, hold out until mom calls and run to the entrance. A win unlocks
      the next danger level."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1461472126296071
    m_Localized: Take the practice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
